    "sections": {
        "description": "<h4>Only HTML &amp; CSS</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Create an HTML and CSS only block. The display does not collapse even if the plugin is deactivate.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Masonry settings</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Width</li>\n<li>Space</li>\n<li>Rounded Images</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Slider settings</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Interval</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How it works</h4>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aQsExk6eDhs?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload <code>simple-block-gallery</code> directory to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "<p>none</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>[1.29] 2025/06/14</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Hides the caption if it is not present in the slider.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>[1.28] 2025/06/13</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix &#8211; CSS.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>[1.27] 2025/06/13</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix &#8211; CSS.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>[1.26] 2025/06/13</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix &#8211; CSS.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>[1.25] 2025/06/12</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix &#8211; CSS.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>[1.24] 2025/06/12</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added &#8211; Caption display.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>[1.23] 2025/06/06</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix &#8211; CSS.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>[1.22] 2025/06/05</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Fixed a problem with blank spaces at the bottom of images in the masonry gallery.</li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Fixed initial loading problem when editing multiple galleries.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>[1.21] 2025/06/05</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added &#8211; Delayed loading is now supported.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>[1.20] 2025/06/04</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Change &#8211; Transitions between parent and child blocks are made easier to understand.</li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Issue regarding display of the last image when there is an even number of images in the slider.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>[1.16] 2025/06/03</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Issues related to unique class names.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>[1.15] 2025/06/03</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Adjustment of the speed at which the slider loops.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>[1.14] 2025/05/20</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Problem with img tags not displaying alt attributes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>[1.13] 2025/04/04</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Rebuilt blocks.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>[1.12] 2024/11/18</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Rebuilt blocks.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>[1.11] 2024/11/09</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Rebuilt blocks.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>[1.10] 2024/07/04</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Problem not working with WordPress 6.5. Rebuild with @wordpress/scripts 27.9.0.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>[1.09] 2024/07/03</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Padding.</li>\n<li>Added &#8211; Lightbox effect of masonry blocks.</li>\n<li>Changed &#8211; In Masonry block, change from a link to an image file to a lightbox effect.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.08</h4>\n<p>Rebuilt blocks.</p>\n<h4>1.07</h4>\n<p>Rebuilt blocks.<br />\nClassified into parent and child blocks.</p>\n<h4>1.06</h4>\n<p>Rebuilt blocks.</p>\n<h4>1.05</h4>\n<p>Supported WordPress 6.4.<br />\nPHP 8.0 is now required.</p>\n<h4>1.04</h4>\n<p>Supported WordPress 6.1.</p>\n<h4>1.03</h4>\n<p>Supported WordPress 6.0.</p>\n<h4>1.02</h4>\n<p>Rebuilt blocks.</p>\n<h4>1.01</h4>\n<p>Supported WordPress 5.6.</p>\n<h4>1.00</h4>\n<p>Initial release.</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Add the effect of Masonry and Slider to images.",
